flowchart TB

%% Option C. One axis, model level: terms
%% simulation process split by the level of the model's physics equation (CWA 17284).
%% Task and solver are linked, not subclasses. Added for comparison.

    Computing["<b>computing process</b><br>PMD_0000583 computing process"]:::local
    Simulation["<b>simulation process</b><br>PMD_0000933 simulation process"]:::local
    Electronic["<b>electronic structure simulation</b><br>PMD_0000933 simulation process<br><br>model describes electrons"]:::proposed
    Atomistic["<b>atomistic simulation</b><br>PMD_0000933 simulation process<br><br>model describes atoms"]:::proposed
    Mesoscopic["<b>mesoscopic simulation</b><br>PMD_0000933 simulation process<br><br>model describes grains or groups of atoms"]:::proposed
    Continuum["<b>continuum simulation</b><br>PMD_0000933 simulation process<br><br>model describes continuum volumes"]:::proposed
    DataBased["<b>data-based simulation</b><br>PMD_0000933 simulation process<br><br>model fitted to data"]:::proposed
    AIMD["<b>ab initio molecular dynamics simulation</b><br>PMD_0000504 ab initio molecular dynamics simulation<br><br>now under electronic and atomistic"]:::changed
    EmpiricalMD["<b>empirical potential molecular dynamics simulation</b><br>PMD_0000631 empirical potential molecular dynamics simulation"]:::changed
    AtomisticMC["<b>atomistic Monte Carlo simulation</b><br>PMD_0000527 atomistic monte carlo simulation"]:::changed
    CoarseGrained["<b>coarse-grained simulation</b><br>PMD_0000562 coarse grained simulation"]:::changed
    MachineLearning["<b>machine learning</b><br>PMD_0000821 machine learning"]:::changed
    Multiscale["<b>multiscale simulation</b><br>PMD_0000866 multiscale simulation"]:::local
    MonteCarlo["<b>monte carlo simulation</b><br>PMD_0000862 monte carlo simulation<br><br>becomes a solver: Monte Carlo method"]:::deprecated
    StructuralOpt["<b>structural optimization simulation</b><br>PMD_0000956 structural optimization simulation<br><br>becomes a task: equilibrium"]:::deprecated
    Task["<b>computational task specification</b><br>IAO_0000005 objective specification"]:::proposed
    PropertyTask["<b>property evaluation task</b><br>IAO_0000005 objective specification<br><br>to compute quantities of a modelled system at one given state"]:::proposed
    EquilibriumTask["<b>equilibrium task</b><br>IAO_0000005 objective specification<br><br>to find a state in which the modelled system is in equilibrium or steady state"]:::proposed
    TimeTask["<b>time evolution task</b><br>IAO_0000005 objective specification<br><br>to compute how the state of a modelled system changes over time"]:::proposed
    SamplingTask["<b>sampling task</b><br>IAO_0000005 objective specification<br><br>to compute averages or distributions over many states, drawn from an ensemble"]:::proposed
    ParameterTask["<b>parameter estimation task</b><br>IAO_0000005 objective specification<br><br>to find values of a model's parameters that agree with given data"]:::proposed
    OptimizationTask["<b>optimization task</b><br>IAO_0000005 objective specification<br><br>to find design variables that best meet an objective under constraints"]:::proposed
    Solver["<b>simulation method specification</b><br>PMD_0000931 simulation method specification"]:::local
    MCMethod["<b>Monte Carlo method</b><br>PMD_0000931 simulation method specification"]:::proposed
    Note["<b>What to look at</b><br>One clear rule for the tree: the level of the model. Methods go to domain ontologies.<br>Ab initio MD and QM/MM need two parents. Multiscale does not fit one level.<br>Task and solver are there, but not used to classify."]:::note

    Computing --> Simulation
    Simulation --> Electronic
    Simulation --> Atomistic
    Simulation --> Mesoscopic
    Simulation --> Continuum
    Simulation --> DataBased
    Electronic --> AIMD
    Atomistic --> AIMD
    Atomistic --> EmpiricalMD
    Atomistic --> AtomisticMC
    Mesoscopic --> CoarseGrained
    DataBased --> MachineLearning
    Simulation --> Multiscale
    Task --> PropertyTask
    Task --> EquilibriumTask
    Task --> TimeTask
    Task --> SamplingTask
    Task --> ParameterTask
    Task --> OptimizationTask
    Solver --> MCMethod
    Simulation -. "executes<br>STATO_0000102" .-> Task
    Simulation -. "executes<br>STATO_0000102" .-> Solver

    classDef local fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1d4ed8,stroke-width:2px,color:#0f172a
    classDef note fill:#fffbeb,stroke:#d97706,color:#374151
    classDef proposed fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#059669,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray:6 3,color:#0f172a
    classDef changed fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#ea580c,stroke-width:2px,color:#0f172a
    classDef deprecated fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#94a3b8,stroke-dasharray:2 2,color:#64748b

